{"sessions":[{"session":0,"messages":["Hey there, just a heads up to keep things brief in our chats.","Going by Priya, and I'm currently diving into research at Databricks.","April 2024 marked when I started there.","Berlin's been my home base for a while now.","My sister Nadia goes by Williams professionally.","Just so you know, my birthday lands on April 18.","Hope that covers the basics for now!"],"conveyed":["s0f5","s0f0","s0f6","s0f2","s0f4","s0f3"]},{"session":1,"messages":["Been thinking about my coffee habits lately - switched from oat milk lattes to straight espresso.","Music tastes have shifted too - techno's been replaced with indie rock.","Tech-wise, I'm comfortable with TypeScript, Swift, and Python.","When I'm not coding, you'll likely find me scaling rock climbing walls.","Photography's another passion of mine that keeps me busy."],"conveyed":["s1f0","s1f1","s1f2","s1f3","s1f4","s1f5","s1f6"]},{"session":2,"messages":["Some career updates from my end.","After wrapping up at Databricks in May 2025, I took a position at Google as a researcher.","That chapter ended this past August 2026 though.","Currently, I'm finding my stride at Vercel."],"conveyed":["s2f0","s2f1","s2f2","s2f3"]},{"session":3,"messages":["Another quick update - I made the move to Seattle in May 2025.","It's quite a change from my time in Berlin."],"conveyed":["s3f0"]},{"session":4,"messages":["Quick work update - Dana's my manager these days.","She's overseeing the Platform team, which I'm now part of.","We're making good use of TypeScript in our current projects."],"conveyed":["s4f0","s4f1","s4f2","s4f3"]},{"session":5,"messages":["Project Granite wrapped up in May 2026, that's done and dusted.","Currently pouring my energy into Project Beacon.","Before Granite, there was Project Atlas which we completed back in March 2026."],"conveyed":["s5f0","s5f1","s5f2"]},{"session":6,"messages":["Had a busy July 3, 2025 organizing that hackathon.","Just wrapped up a blog post publication on July 24, 2026."],"conveyed":["s6f0","s6f1"]},{"session":7,"messages":["November 14, 2025 saw me speaking at that conference.","January 15, 2026 was quite the day - ran a marathon!","On the music front, I've fully committed to indie rock now."],"conveyed":["s7f0","s7f1","s7f2"]}]}
